record jpegxl-rs.evidence.gap-g5-bounded-entropy-screen-2026-08-21/1 : evidence {
    title "G5 bounded entropy promotion screen"
    state verified
    result pass
    method observation
    observed_at git:87240fdde463152c52cfaae2bb35e0662990e39b
    summary """
        The promoted legacy-plus-one bounded model improved mean SSIMULACRA2 by 1.721 over nine fixed-rate cells after the <4 KiB legacy gate; worst SSIMULACRA2 delta was -0.0543 and median wall overhead was 12.63% (4.3 MP) / 9.50% (12 MP), within the 15% gate. Diagnostics showed three distinct quantizer plans emitted once each, so no control-image cache was added.
