record jpegxl-rs.evidence.modular-search-chaff-2026-08-10/1 : evidence {
    title "Reproduced at 70688ac on the 4000x3000 (12MP) real-photo corpus input. Effort 1: cheap_scores=1 exact_prices=0 residual_scans=1, wall_ms_median=1025.6, output_bytes=9795599, fingerprint=dc380915d983b360. Effort 7: cheap_scores=69 exact_prices=2 residual_scans=71, wall_ms_median=19651.5, output_bytes=9795599, fingerprint=dc380915d983b360. The full search performs 71x the residual scans and 19.2x the wall time to arrive at a byte-identical, fingerprint-identical codestream: on this content the search above effort 1 buys nothing at all. This is one 12MP photograph plus the corpus sweep in .agent/scratch/effort-ramp-2026-08-10; it is not a claim about flat, paletteable, or line-art content, where effort 1 was measured ~3.7% larger on a synthetic screenshot fixture."
