record jpegxl-rs.evidence.phase4g-bound-and-identity-tests-2026-08-10/1 : evidence {
    title "At 2b7b5c0 the jpxl-encode library suite is 122 passed, 0 failed, 0 ignored -- 117 pre-4G plus five gates this work added. bounded_budget_is_a_noop_below_the_budget asserts that for every shipped effort level a frame inside the budget scores at the floor stride, including the exact boundary, so the plumbing cannot change output on sub-budget frames. bounded_budget_raises_the_stride_with_frame_size asserts the stride rises with frame size and that scored samples stay within the budget plus at most two partial rows -- slack that is a function of row cost, not frame area, which is the property that makes ranking cost frame-size-independent. a_zero_budget_falls_back_to_the_floor_stride pins the degenerate cases. empty_overrides_leave_every_effort_budget_untouched and each_override_replaces_only_its_own_lever pin the measurement escape hatch as inert by default. Separately verified: the one workspace failure, both_oracles_decode_a_stream_from_the_hf_mul_segment in jpxl-encode-policy/tests/vardct_oracle.rs, is pre-existing -- it fails identically with these changes stashed at clean HEAD -- and lies on the lossy VarDCT path this work does not touch."
    state verified
    result pass
    method command
    observed_at git:2b7b5c0b8009e7cd220273cf621c72a5d3d9d4b0
    command "cargo test -p jpxl-encode --lib"
    summary """
        At 2b7b5c0 the jpxl-encode library suite is 122 passed, 0 failed, 0 ignored -- 117 pre-4G plus five gates this work added. bounded_budget_is_a_noop_below_the_budget asserts that for every shipped effort level a frame inside the budget scores at the floor stride, including the exact boundary, so the plumbing cannot change output on sub-budget frames. bounded_budget_raises_the_stride_with_frame_size asserts the stride rises with frame size and that scored samples stay within the budget plus at most two partial rows -- slack that is a function of row cost, not frame area, which is the property that makes ranking cost frame-size-independent. a_zero_budget_falls_back_to_the_floor_stride pins the degenerate cases. empty_overrides_leave_every_effort_budget_untouched and each_override_replaces_only_its_own_lever pin the measurement escape hatch as inert by default. Separately verified: the one workspace failure, both_oracles_decode_a_stream_from_the_hf_mul_segment in jpxl-encode-policy/tests/vardct_oracle.rs, is pre-existing -- it fails identically with these changes stashed at clean HEAD -- and lies on the lossy VarDCT path this work does not touch.
        """
    author "GitHub Uploader"
}

